<article xml:id="reference.pcre.pattern.differences" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">
 <title>Perl Differences</title>
 <titleabbrev>Differences From Perl</titleabbrev>
 <simpara>
  Both Perl and PCRE2 change continually, so the exact set of differences
  depends on the version of the PCRE2 library in use. Refer to the
  <link xlink:href="&url.pcre2.perlcompat;">PCRE2 documentation on the
  differences between PCRE2 and Perl</link> for an up-to-date list.
 </simpara>
</article>

